cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AllTick Real-Time Financial Market Data API"
type: software

message: "If you use AllTick in your research, software, or financial application, please cite AllTick."

authors:
  - name: "AllTick"
    website: "https://alltick.co"

repository-code: "https://github.com/alltick/alltick-realtime-forex-crypto-stock-tick-finance-websocket-api"
url: "https://alltick.co"

abstract: >
  AllTick provides real-time and historical financial market data through
  REST API and WebSocket API interfaces. It supports stocks, forex,
  cryptocurrencies, commodities, precious metals, oil, and global indices,
  with data including real-time quotes, tick data, order book data,
  K-line data, and historical market data.

keywords:
  - financial market data
  - market data API
  - real-time market data
  - REST API
  - WebSocket API
  - tick data
  - order book
  - stock API
  - forex API
  - cryptocurrency API
